# Springheart Nantuko's landfall: "you may pay {1}{G} if this permanent is attached to a creature you control. If you do,
# create a token that's a copy of that creature. If you didn't create a token this way, create a 1/1 green Insect creature
# token." Bestowed on Llanowar Elves, a Forest on turn 3 asks for {1}{G}, paid by the Forest and a Mox, and makes a token
# copy of the Elves. On turn 5 Bot1 declines and gets an Insect instead.

